MINIMAL RUST TEST BINARIES (theo từng giai đoạn)
Giai đoạn 1 — chỉ exit + write
// hello.rs
fn main() {
    println!("hello");
}


Compile:

rustc hello.rs \
  --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl \
  -C target-feature=+crt-static


Kernel cần:

write

exit

Giai đoạn 2 — malloc + mmap
fn main() {
    let mut v = Vec::new();
    for i in 0..1000 {
        v.push(i);
    }
    println!("{}", v.len());
}


Kernel cần:

mmap

brk

page fault

Giai đoạn 3 — panic Rust (signal / abort)
fn main() {
    panic!("test panic");
}


Kernel cần:

write

exit

(signal optional, abort OK)

Giai đoạn 4 — TLS (Rust bắt đầu khó)
thread_local! {
    static X: u64 = 42;
}

fn main() {
    X.with(|v| println!("{}", v));
}


Kernel cần:

arch_prctl

fs.base

TLS ABI

Giai đoạn 5 — Thread + futex
use std::thread;

fn main() {
    let h = thread::spawn(|| {
        println!("child");
    });
    h.join().unwrap();
}


Kernel cần:

clone

futex
